    "result_text": "All 7 test files accounted for (5 checkpoint test classes + base + helper), 11 tests total, all green. The full suite passes.\n\n## Summary\n\nThe change adds a computed `displayName` field to owners, formatted as `LastName, FirstName` from the stored names.\n\nSince `OwnerDto` is generated from the OpenAPI spec via openapi-generator + MapStruct, I made two edits:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a read-only `displayName` string property to the `Owner` schema, so the generated `OwnerDto` (and thus every owner response, including `GET /api/owners/{id}`) exposes the field.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a MapStruct `@Mapping` expression on `toOwnerDto` that computes `displayName` as `owner.getLastName() + \", \" + owner.getFirstName()` from the stored names.\n\n`Cp05Tests` now passes, and the full suite is green (11/11, `BUILD SUCCESS`).",
